window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Book 6 of the best-selling Contamination series, with more than 3,000 five-star reviews across Amazon!</b></p> <p>In a world of danger, reprieve is only temporary.</p> <p>For days, the farmhouse has been a place of safety for Dan, Quinn, Meredith, and John. But a new threat is emerging, one that threatens to destroy the group from the inside out.</p> <p>In order to get to freedom, they'll need to survive one last journey. And that journey might cost them their lives....</p>"; 
